hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"148","Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj told us, Ibn Idris told us, Ibn Ajlan told us, on the authority of Zayd bin Aslam, on the authority of Ata’ bin Yasar, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, he said: I saw the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace. He performed ablution, scooped a scoop, rinsed his mouth and sniffed, then scooped a scoop and washed his face, then rinsed his mouth. He washed his right hand a room, then he scooped a room and washed his left hand, and he scooped a room and wiped his head and the insides of his ears and the outsides of them, and he entered He put his two fingers in them, and he went a room and washed his right foot, and a room and washed his left foot.”"
